<ExerciseBridge title="Meaning, not appearance">

“HTML tags must be used for their semantic value, not their appearance. It's always possible to totally change the look and feel of a given tag using CSS so, when using HTML, take the time to focus on the meaning rather than the appearance.” [Source: MDN](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Guides/Cheatsheet)

